{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 51, :comments ["<b>For you are crossing the Jordan, etc. And you shall dispossess, etc.</b> But were they not warned about this many times? Rather, this is what Moses said to them: When you cross the Jordan on dry ground — it is on this condition that you cross, and if not — the waters come and sweep you away. And so we find that Joshua said to them (Joshua 4) while they were still in the Jordan (Sotah 34)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:39.882381234Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}